{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scverse/liana/pulls/261","id":4456836966,"node_id":"PR_kwDOIC-hCs8AAAABCaXvZg","html_url":"https://github.com/scverse/liana/pull/261","diff_url":"https://github.com/scverse/liana/pull/261.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/scverse/liana/pull/261.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scverse/liana/issues/261","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scverse/liana/pulls/261/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scverse/liana/pulls/261/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scverse/liana/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scverse/liana/issues/261/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scverse/liana/statuses/e202237078e50e53dbe4bef511e59114dc673441","number":261,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Skill; Standardize props; versioning","user":{"login":"dbdimitrov","id":50865230,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODY1MjMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50865230?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov","html_url":"https://github.com/dbdimitrov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbdimitrov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Added\r\n- **Claude Code Agent Skill** in `src/liana/_skills` (SKILL.md + per-topic references), installed via the new `liana-install-skills` console script (`--force` to overwrite). README/installation docs updated; eval notes in `tests/skills/evals.md`.\r\n- **`li.pl.elbow`** replaces the plot `li.ms.nmf` used to draw as a side effect (#99). `nmf` still stores the curve in `uns[\"nmf_errors\"]`.\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n- **Proportion thresholds standardised.** `expr_prop` (within cell-type group) and `nz_prop` (across all observations) are now distinct, both default to `0.05`, and live in `DefaultValues`. `expr_prop` was `0.1` for single-cell methods; `nz_prop` was `0.001` for `inflow` and unmasked for `lric`'s agnostic mode, which gains `nz_prop`.\r\n- **`rank_aggregate` `magnitude_rank`** ranks each score column once. Connectome and NATMI share `expr_prod`, which was previously ranked twice, reversing its contribution. Warns when aggregating fewer than two methods (e.g. `n_perms=None`).\r\n- **`li.pp.spatial_neighbors` and `MistyData`** accept `MuData` and sparse connectivities.\r\n- **`by_sample(inplace=False)`** no longer writes to `.uns`.\r\n- **`to_tensor_c2c`**: `sample_key` and `score_key` are keyword-only and required.\r\n\r\n### Packaging\r\n- **Version from git tags via hatch-vcs.** `bumpversion`, `.bumpversion.cfg` and `liana.__version__` removed; use `importlib.metadata.version(\"liana\")`. Release = publish a `vX.Y.Z` tag.\r\n- **`mudata>=0.4`, `muon>=0.1.9`** required (h5mu writes fail with anndata ≥ 0.13 otherwise).","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-06T15:16:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T07:06:26Z","closed_at":"2026-09-09T07:06:26Z","merged_at":"2026-09-09T07:06:26Z","merge_commit_sha":"d4211373692e7b9c10210488ccb1efe06452b097","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"scverse:skill","ref":"skill","repo":{"id":539992330,"node_id":"R_kgDOIC-hCg","name":"liana","full_name":"scverse/liana","owner":{"login":"scverse","id":95305807,"node_id":"O_kgDOBa5ATw","avatar_url":"https://avatars